[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mValidation only (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mPure function: rules + data in, errors out. No DOM. Each form keeps its own submit handler and error display.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Validation + error rendering
     [38;5;246mShared validator plus a shared helper to display errors. Each form still writes its own submit handler.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Validation + form binding
     [38;5;246mOne call wires a form end to end: reads inputs, intercepts submit, validates, renders errors, calls your handler.[39m
